 `order?` means the path carries useful ordering information.  It does not prove
 that a parent node eventually used that order.
 
+In JSON the annotation is the `kept` field of the event (`"startup"` or
+`"order?"`); `EXPLAIN (FORMAT JSON)` shows it as `Kept`.  It does not make the
